    "body": "Rework (UMA) @ 9b01def4 - review findings + conflict. Still a draft; not re-flagged ready.\n\n**Conflict resolution** (`git merge upstream/main`, merge commit, no rebase/force): `rapids_posed.rs` and `solid.rs` - main added a new `hits()` argument (`&[]` / the hole-wall axes `axes_in(&fr, walls)`); kept main's call with the branch's `is_upright` filter. Re-applied `is_upright` at main's new #1091 stock-top site (`stock_top.rs`, which had its own exact 1e-12 component test for \"upright dive\"). No other `is_vertical` branch is left in `crates/sim/src/verify/` outside `upright.rs`. `git diff upstream/main --stat` lists only this PR's files.\n\n**Findings**\n1. Blocker - `tilt_tolerance.rs` missing `model_excess` (#864): fixed with `..Default::default()` so a future context field does not break it again. `tilt_tolerance` 5/5.\n2. Note - law (c) de-dup used `warns.last()`, shared with earlier laws (b2 `solid_hits`): fixed; law (c) now tracks its own last verdict per move (`reported`), so it never merges with another law's warning. `tool_body_bands` unchanged and green.\n3. Note - the cliff just above the tolerance: filed #1303 (exact R·sin θ band dip), as the decision file names it out of scope here.\n4. Note - double blank line in `upright.rs`: fixed.\n5. Note - stale `avoid.rs` comment (motion): left as-is, already recorded in the decision file; a comment-only touch to motion would pull the slow motion suites into this PR's gate. It can ride the next motion PR or #1303.\n\n**New pin**: `verify::stock_top::tests::a_rounding_noise_pose_is_an_upright_dive_and_a_real_tilt_is_not` (1e-10 deg acquitted like upright, failing on the old 1e-12 component test; 0.001 deg keeps its conviction).\n\n**Gate on 9b01def4**: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` - sim suites ok (15s), motion real_tip/solid_law ok (7s), app suites incl. tool_body_bands ok (259s), 0 failed. By hand: sim `posed_fixture` 7/7, `stock_posed` 3/3, `tilt_tolerance` 5/5. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean. Batch/release tiers and `--ignored` lanes not run.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
